        <li><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/basemodel/blob/main/src/components/research/OpenEvoEffectiveStateGdrLoraStudy.astro"><ExternalBrandMark href="https://github.com/mykcs/basemodel/blob/main/src/components/research/OpenEvoEffectiveStateGdrLoraStudy.astro" />三条 160 轮路线的结果与对应实验记录</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/597"><ExternalBrandMark href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/597" />rank32/rank128 1,024 次匹配任务与文件大小</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/634"><ExternalBrandMark href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/634" />Task Vector 方向反转实验</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/636"><ExternalBrandMark href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/636" />Text Memory / Skill / Agent System 载体记录与后续计划</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/632"><ExternalBrandMark href="https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/pull/632" />简单非负 β 的独立研究线</a></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppLayout>
